9 0 obj
<< /Length 970 >>
stream
BT /F1 16 Tf 50 720 Td (3. Hybrid Search and Reciprocal Rank Fusion) Tj 0 -25 Td /F3 10 Tf (Hybrid search merges sparse lexical retrieval (BM25) with dense vector retrieval.) Tj 0 -15 Td (Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF) computes: RRF_score(d) = sum( 1 / (60 + rank_i(d)) ).) Tj 0 -15 Td (This achieves robust keyword matching (exact codes, acronyms) and deep semantic relevance.) Tj 0 -30 Td /F2 12 Tf (4. Multi-Query Expansion & Sub-Query Decomposition) Tj 0 -15 Td /F3 10 Tf (LLM generates 3-5 query variants from different perspectives to mitigate single-query bias.) Tj 0 -15 Td (Documents from all generated queries are fetched and deduplicated via union scoring.) Tj 0 -30 Td /F2 12 Tf (5. Hypothetical Document Embeddings (HyDE)) Tj 0 -15 Td /F3 10 Tf (HyDE instructs an LLM to generate a hypothetical answer document before embedding.) Tj 0 -15 Td (The hypothetical document is embedded, aligning the query closer to document passage vectors in latent space.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
