11 0 obj
<< /Length 959 >>
stream
BT /F1 16 Tf 50 720 Td (6. Two-Stage Cross-Encoder Re-Ranking) Tj 0 -25 Td /F3 10 Tf (First stage retrieves a wide candidate pool (top-25) using fast bi-encoder similarity.) Tj 0 -15 Td (Second stage computes all-to-all cross-attention between question and passage: score = CrossEncoder(q, d).) Tj 0 -15 Td (Top-k candidates (e.g. k=5) with highest re-ranking scores are provided to the generator.) Tj 0 -30 Td /F2 12 Tf (7. Hierarchical Parent-Child Chunking) Tj 0 -15 Td /F3 10 Tf (Documents are split into small 200-character child chunks for fine-grained vector similarity search.) Tj 0 -15 Td (Upon retrieval, child chunks map to their 1200-character parent chunk to give rich context to the LLM.) Tj 0 -30 Td /F2 12 Tf (8. Experimental Benchmark Results) Tj 0 -15 Td /F3 10 Tf (Cross-Encoder Re-ranking achieved highest MRR@5 (0.892) and NDCG@5 (0.914).) Tj 0 -15 Td (Hybrid RRF provided the best balance of latency (48ms) and Hit Rate@5 (96.4%).) Tj ET
endstream
